# {{name}}

MCP App scaffolded with `mountly-mcp create --framework vue`.

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev
pnpm verify
```

- View: `src/view.ts` + `src/Dashboard.vue`
- Server: `server.mjs` (`registerMcpApps`)

Do not clone the Mountly monorepo for greenfield apps — this project is the canonical path.
